<title>BELGIUM: EU Wednesday meeting to discuss beet sugar balance.</title>
<headline>EU Wednesday meeting to discuss beet sugar balance.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee will discuss the final sugar balance sheet for 1995/96 on Wednesday, an EU official said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The committee will also discuss the provisional balance sheet for 1996/97,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The current year's production figures cannot be finalised as some member states are still lifting beet crops.</p>
<p>The committee will also discuss the molasses balance sheet for 1995/96, and will set molasses import duties. --Chris White, Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
